OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1786128506
OL,3,CMen accused of using teenagers from
OL,4,CCardiff as drug couriers in Thailand
OL,6,FThree men are accused of trafficking
OL,7,Fteenagers to Thailand as part of an
OL,8,Finternational drug ring, a court has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FLevi Coomansingh, 20, Patrick
OL,12,FO'Driscoll, 30, and Gareth Press, 42,
OL,13,Fappeared at Cardiff Magistrates' Court
OL,14,Fon Friday charged with drug offences
OL,15,Fand conspiring to arrange the travel
OL,16,Fof another with a view to exploitation.
OL,18,FThe court heard the men are accused of
OL,19,Fusing two teenage boys as drug
OL,20,Fcouriers.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/5
