CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1786128506
OL,3,CMen accused of using teenagers from
OL,4,CCardiff as drug couriers in Thailand
OL,6,FThe teenagers were allegedly caught
OL,7,Fcarrying 64kg of cannabis "concealed
OL,8,Fwithin their suitcases" while trying
OL,9,Fto travel back to the UK.
OL,11,FThe two 17-year-olds from Cardiff were
OL,12,Farrested in Thailand in June and
OL,13,Fremain in custody, South Wales Police
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FThe investigation into an alleged
OL,17,Forganised criminal network operating
OL,18,Fbetween the UK and Thailand led to the
OL,19,Farrests of the men earlier this week.
OL,26,@oD@[OUpD@WO]
