CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1786128506
OL,3,CMen accused of using teenagers from
OL,4,CCardiff as drug couriers in Thailand
OL,6,FThe three men appeared in the dock
OL,7,Ftogether and were not asked to enter
OL,8,Fpleas.
OL,10,FMagistrate Peter Welsh said: "These
OL,11,Fmatters have to go to Cardiff Crown
OL,12,FCourt. Your next appearance will be on
OL,13,FSeptember 4th.
OL,15,F"You will be remanded in custody."
OL,17,FShe was released on conditional bail
OL,18,Fto appear at Cardiff Crown Court on
OL,19,Fthe same date.
