OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1786128506
OL,3,CMen accused of using teenagers from
OL,4,CCardiff as drug couriers in Thailand
OL,6,FIn June, South Wales Police was made
OL,7,Faware that two 17-year-olds from
OL,8,FCardiff had been arrested in Thailand.
OL,10,FThe force subsequently launched an
OL,11,Finvestigation into the circumstances
OL,12,Fwhich led to the children travelling
OL,13,Fto the country.
OL,15,FA spokesman for South Wales Police
OL,16,Fsaid: "The children remain in custody
OL,17,Fin Thailand where they are being
OL,18,Fsupported by their families and the
OL,19,FForeign and Commonwealth Office.
OL,26,@xD@GOU
