PN,43305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1786128506
OL,3,CMen accused of using teenagers from
OL,4,CCardiff as drug couriers in Thailand
OL,6,F"The families have been updated
OL,7,Fregarding the arrests and charges.
OL,9,F"We understand this continues to be a
OL,10,Fconcerning time for them and the wider
OL,11,Fcommunity.''
OL,13,FA 23-year-old man from Keighley, West
OL,14,FYorkshire, was also arrested on
OL,15,Fsuspicion of improper importation of
OL,16,Fcontrolled drugs and is on police bail.
